{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03112","headline":"奉和圣制南郊礼毕酺宴 · 张九龄","name":"奉和圣制南郊礼毕酺宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"配天昭圣业，率土庆辉光。\n春发三条路，酺开百戏场。\n流恩均庶品，纵观聚康庄。\n妙舞来平乐，新声出建章。\n分曹日抱戴，赴节凤归昌。\n幸奏承云乐，同曦湛露阳。\n气和皆有感，泽厚自无疆。\n饱德君臣醉，连歌奉柏梁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}